  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Central capacities </h3> <h1> Add-on »z.Resources« </h1>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER TMS, with the <strong>add-on »z.Resources«</strong>, manages all additional resources: All relevant resources are directly associated with the component and automatically appear in the setup sheet – including test equipment, fixtures, and optionally NC program management. The optional NC program management enables centralized, component- and machine-specific storage and versioning of NC programs, ensuring that the correct program in its current version is always available.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/tr/company/contact\">Request now</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/9/csm_zResources_product_64dda2209d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1080,
     "h": 852
