  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Add-on »z.Resources« </h3> <h2> Continuity </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The add‑on ensures that all necessary resources are immediately available during setup – without any searching, inquiries or delays. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">Incorrect equipment, outdated programs or missing resources are ruled out. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">With the add-on, every use of resources is fully documented and traceable.</p>",
